codex
The downloaded dolphin mesh has finite vertices and consistent winding, but it reproduces the known closure defect: 3,878 boundary edges, so it is not watertight. The first live run took 308 seconds to reach “Done,” including cold loads. I’ll report export success separately from mesh validity.

